BeAGLE is installed to /usr/local.
The /work directory is pre-configured with some required symlinks.
When running from a different directory, you may need to manually do:

  ln -s /usr/local/fluka/nuclear.bin .
  ln -s /usr/local/share/BeAGLE/eAt1dfJn .
  mkdir outForPythiaMode

Running is

  BeAGLE < /usr/local/share/BeAGLE/<input_file>.inp

